# Generated / third-party icon assets.
#
# These are built from the icon theme installed on the machine, from local app
# installs, or from vendor artwork, so they are not redistributed here. After a
# fresh clone, rebuild them with:
#   center-cluster/scripts/sync-icons.sh      app, system, media, weather icons
#   center-cluster/scripts/sync-ai-icons.sh   Claude / Hermes / ChatGPT marks
# The profile artwork is not regenerable by script - see center-cluster/README.md.
center-cluster/images/icons/apps/
center-cluster/images/icons/system/
center-cluster/images/icons/ui/
center-cluster/images/icons/music/
center-cluster/images/icons/weather/
center-cluster/images/icons/ai/*
!center-cluster/images/icons/ai/duck.png
center-cluster/images/icons/websites/whatsapp.png
